  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping Help Guide\n\n### How to Create Advance Receipts\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 16 Sep, 2021 at 10:58 AM\n\n\t\tLocation: Bookkeeping > Dashboard > Client Dashboard > Reports > Customer > Advance Report\n\nRefer to the link\n\nHelp/Guide:\n\nAdvance receipts can be created from Sales > Receipts > New Receipt > select 'Make Advance Receipt' \n\nOnce the Advance Receipts have been setup, the reports can be viewed from the Reports section (as shown below) \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000185558\">Bookkeeping Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to Create Advance Receipts\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 16 Sep, 2021 at 10:58 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Location</strong>: Bookkeeping &gt; Dashboard &gt; Client Dashboard &gt; Reports &gt; Customer &gt; Advance Report</p><p><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/bookkeeping/reports/Advance.aspx?type=customer\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Refer to the link</a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Help/Guide:</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Advance receipts can be created from Sales &gt; Receipts &gt; New Receipt &gt; select 'Make Advance Receipt'&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9082347872/original/O53Ps5m_LN2QpCkShGGjJLwYCKMboUvWsw.png?1563898590\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9082347872/original/O53Ps5m_LN2QpCkShGGjJLwYCKMboUvWsw.png?1563898590\" data-fileid=\"9082347872\" data-uniquekey=\"1563898099180\" style=\"width: 832px;\"></p><p><br></p><p>Once the Advance Receipts have been setup, the reports can be viewed from the Reports section (as shown below)&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9082348171/original/imJ9g9ohMiuRTkBi1s9iSL2qbdSlEQEcHA.png?1563898763\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9082348171/original/imJ9g9ohMiuRTkBi1s9iSL2qbdSlEQEcHA.png?1563898763\" data-fileid=\"9082348171\" data-uniquekey=\"1563898099180\" style=\"width: 831px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172894\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000172894/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172894\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000172894/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172894\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this ar